b625721094e35f" height=3D"257"></p>
<h1 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-ArchitectureDecisions">Architecture=
 Decisions</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Decision No.</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">ADR-001</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Plat=
form Access Management (PAM) scope</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span>PAM <strong>includes</strong>:</span></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"42b8363f-90cd-4d35-97d3-cdcb29546bb7"><span>Service =
Catalog;</span></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"80aab551-0115-412a-a021-1222cddc25a8"><span>Feature =
Management;</span></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"d4c7dae7-d753-4f8a-9b55-da9e02027de0"><span>Access R=
equest Submission;</span></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"285f5bf8-ea08-467c-877e-4bdb3917a7a9"><span>Access R=
equest Status Tracking;</span></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"0513354e-28b4-4a09-a54f-718fb697e195"><span>Consumer=
 Notifications.</span></li>
     </ul>
     <p><span>PAM <strong>excludes</strong>:</span></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4d527217-a4f0-48aa-8f4a-f3d10b80dad3">Ticket Managem=
ent;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3be4d091-f310-43e3-abf9-3cc1863d3720">
       <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Ca=
se Management;</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"abab4b62-43a3-4ea9-ac7b-41a6d8142dc6">
       <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">In=
cident Management;</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"71e05dd1-388b-440c-a74a-530458b19826">
       <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">SL=
A Management;</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a272b8fd-e7ae-4688-858c-00d213f51b81">
       <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Wo=
rkflow Management;</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1f4a37ab-fa03-48ce-a91d-ae642a79e4d4">Operational Ta=
sk Management.</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">ADR-002</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Stat=
us derived from events</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Requ=
est status is projected from lifecycle events.</p>
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Rati=
onale:</p>
     <ul>
      <li class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg" da=
ta-uuid=3D"b12288c4-8116-4ee8-8125-37423a4f8943">Avoid workflow coupling;</=
li>
      <li class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg" da=
ta-uuid=3D"db146562-7fc6-4cfe-be8c-9c66a16463e9">Enable multiple producers;=
</li>
      <li class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg" da=
ta-uuid=3D"b8b291c1-51eb-4e24-9e60-fb02937b11e7">Preserve future integratio=
n flexibility.</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">ADR-003</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Even=
t Store as source of truth</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Life=
cycle events are recorded and retained.</p>
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Requ=
est status is derived from recorded events.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">ADR-004</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">PAM =
integration model</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Prod=
ucer systems communicate lifecycle changes through the Event API.</p>
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">e.g.=
&nbsp;</p>
     <ul>
      <li class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg" da=
ta-uuid=3D"5442ba50-5f44-4346-ab60-87a8c85ac53e">FUM;</li>
      <li class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg" da=
ta-uuid=3D"ff6ad8bb-150b-4d3e-a453-5476d5877ad4">Administrative Interfaces;=
</li>
      <li class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg" da=
ta-uuid=3D"be4fc33b-9157-4d7e-82fc-5e1cbe499686">Future Systems.</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h1 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-Non-FunctionalRequirements">Non-Fun=
ctional Requirements</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Req. No.</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR.001</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Auditability</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">All =
lifecycle events shall be retained.</p>
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Life=
cycle events shall be traceable to requests.</p>
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">The =
platform shall support identification of the actor or system responsible fo=
r a lifecycle event.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR-002</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Security</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Only=
 authorized producers may submit events.</p>
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Cons=
umers may only view authorized requests.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR-003</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Extensibility</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Addi=
tional event producers can be integrated without redesign.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR-004</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Maintainability</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Request lifecycle producers shall be loosely coupled from PAM throu=
gh event-based integration.</p>
     <p>The platform shall support the addition of new lifecycle event type=
s without significant redesign.</p>
     <p>The platform shall support future consumers of request lifecycle ev=
ents.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR-005</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Future Compatibility</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>The platform shall remain compatible with future integration with e=
nterprise workflow or service management platforms.</p>
     <p>The consumer-facing experience shall remain independent from any sp=
ecific workflow or service management platform.</p>
     <p>Request status shall be derived from recorded lifecycle events.</p>=
</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h1 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-TechnicalSpecifications">Technical =
Specifications</h1>
<h2 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-EventSpecifications">Event Specific=
ations</h2>
<h3 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-Event">Event</h3>
<h4 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-Definition">Definition</h4>
<p>Events represent business facts that occurred during the lifecycle of an=
 access request.</p>
<p>Events provide:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"3a5c1aed-ab8a-4dd0-be83-38a3da210896">Traceability</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b47ab058-f993-4414-82c8-c68261be4249">Current status deri=
vation</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a6a15f91-f255-45b0-9e2d-1a19d7ba00e6">Consumer visibility=
</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6c250a01-b773-4764-a7db-c5696402005d">Notification trigge=
ring</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6947be0e-90eb-4e7a-b371-2a4a4e167f0a">Future integration =
opportunities</li>
</ul>
<p>Events are the authoritative record of request progression.</p>
<h4 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-Principles">Principles</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Spec. No.</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">ES-001</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Events represent facts</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Events shall record things that have already occurred.</p>
     <p>Events do not represent intentions or future actions.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">ES-002</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Events are immutable</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Once recorded, events shall not be modified.</p>
     <p>Corrections shall be represented by new events.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">ES-003</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Events are append-only</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Request history shall be preserved by appending new events rather t=
han modifying historical events.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">ES-004</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Status is derived from events</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Request status shall not be treated as the primary source of truth.=
</p>
     <p>Status shall be derived from recorded events.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">ES-005</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Events are producer-agnostic</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>PAM shall process events independently of the originating producer.=
</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-EventContract">Event Contract</h3>
<p>Every lifecycle event shall contain:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1f98fedb-4278-497c-8912-0d583e5af16f">
  <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">eventId=
</p>
  <ul>
   <li>
    <p>Unique identifier for the event.</p></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e9ba333a-ce09-4806-9370-7f2a6e491ddc">
  <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">request=
Id</p>
  <ul>
   <li>
    <p>Identifies the request affected by the event.</p></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6d4c0a2a-9452-4ecf-a610-3e356713099f">
  <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">eventTy=
pe</p>
  <ul>
   <li>
    <p>Identifies the business fact represented by the event.</p></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"893c6392-817d-48db-8be1-512012ac4f87">
  <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">eventTi=
mestamp</p>
  <ul>
   <li>
    <p>Time at which the event occurred.</p></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"21ecee95-71f8-4c06-ae4e-36bb9be6f7ba">
  <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">source<=
/p>
  <ul>
   <li>
    <p>Identifies the producer system.</p></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e273a2b9-df47-4bcc-b088-ba97231876d1">
  <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">actor</=
p>
  <ul>
   <li>
    <p>Identifies the user or system responsible for the event.</p></li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p>Optional:</p>
<ul>
 <li><span>correlationId</span></li>
 <li style=3D"color:#c9372c;" data-uuid=3D"e4a40266-b6c2-4a55-8fb3-f428acb0=
d1d3"><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">reason</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4b93d888-3e17-4bc7-9314-b5cded1540b7"><span>metadata</spa=
n></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-EventCatalog">Event Catalog</h3>
<p>List of supported event types, as recognized by PAM:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b14ab8b4-dc7d-499b-9431-3ec98db6ebb3"><span>AccessRequest=
Submitted</span>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"6a255073-4f1a-43fa-a0bf-7579b8241724">
    <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">An ac=
cess request has been successfully submitted.</p></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2688d8d0-1fbb-4374-800a-576652ff64b9"><span>AccessRequest=
Approved</span>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"129bceeb-8384-477d-8716-7caa422841f9">
    <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">Appro=
val has been granted.</p></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"90f21541-4b24-43c5-aa93-7c56bc1bd1cb"><span>AccessRequest=
Rejected</span>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"c977c026-037c-42eb-b199-104927ee725b">
    <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">The r=
equest has been denied.</p></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c67fa973-8c09-4ded-8c31-45691c992232"><span>AccessProvisi=
oned</span>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"43f7bd03-fecb-44e5-85a0-8180fe2d93bb">
    <p class=3D"___1sql8mq f1rh9g5y f11qrl6u f19n0e5 fibxuh5 f4fkekg">The a=
pproved access has been provisioned.</p></li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p>Optional:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9f722277-e13a-41b8-820a-6ca49ee90fdb">AccessRequestPendin=
gUserFeedback/Action/Info</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-EventProcessing">Event Processing</=
h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 74=
.7526%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 10.0562%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 20.8639%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 69.0799%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Spec. No.</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">EPS-001</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Persist before process</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Events shall be persisted before processing.</p>
     <p><span>Producer <span>=E2=86=92 </span></span><span>Event API </span=
><span>=E2=86=92&nbsp;</span><span>Event Store<span> =E2=86=92</span> </spa=
n><span>Event Handler<span> <span>=E2=86=92 </span></span></span><span>Proj=
ections</span></p>
     <p>Rationale:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f294756b-2367-4aab-b5a6-2db50e67cf8f">Guarantees tra=
ceability</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3db24d5f-8d13-4da6-9d59-158313db464a">Prevents loss =
of lifecycle information</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"09d07a0a-9925-4a2d-8b17-1c5e9bf2f06e">Makes the Even=
t Store the authoritative record</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">EPS-002</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Immutable event history</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Event processing shall not modify historical events.</p>
     <p>Rationale:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e1b28031-0a6b-4767-b33d-e0b7d0c513cc">Preserves audi=
tability</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7819b056-d262-43c9-a3d4-60766211f9ff">Maintains even=
t integrity</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"58067702-b2a4-4bb6-a560-afb71c16bd5c">Supports compl=
ete lifecycle reconstruction</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">EPS-003</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Event-Driven state projection</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Consumers shall react to events rather than directly modifying requ=
est state.</p>
     <p>Rationale:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1df1c937-1029-4e3a-b929-e988f6ce6cc4">Keeps status d=
erived from events</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"361da341-7219-4e6a-8783-67fb4d3d89b4">Avoids multipl=
e sources of truth</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b1be6c7f-ba73-4007-aeea-c6f22c884808">Promotes loose=
 coupling</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">EPS-004</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Deterministic event processing</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Processing outcomes shall be deterministic, i.e. the resulting stat=
us and notifications shall always be the same.</p>
     <p>Rationale:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"d2eb503f-ea67-4c6a-9491-5b00e1298f08">Predictable sy=
stem behaviour</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"665dca69-030a-46dd-9fef-16fa53f98b96">Easier trouble=
shooting</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"472a09a4-c2b3-4d6b-ae2d-e9180e0f9198">Consistent use=
r experience</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-EventLifecycleGovernance">Event Lif=
ecycle Governance</h3>
<p>Events recognized by PAM shall be limited to access request lifecycle ev=
ents.</p>
<p>PAM shall not introduce event types related to:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f7e13fcb-efd9-46d4-9a0d-6ed95eaea6f3"><span>Ticket Manage=
ment</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"5d29b3e9-7166-4fd2-9922-d8aa815ae87c"><span>Incident Mana=
gement</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"64166847-11d2-49db-8074-fe091a194ea9"><span>Case Manageme=
nt</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"15b57bbe-aa58-46d1-8182-44f497a7dc82"><span>Task Manageme=
nt</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4f8710f8-4687-41b8-9f2f-0f1ad3fff564"><span>Workflow Mana=
gement</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"cc673835-a1b2-425e-b6bf-689306c1b4f3"><span>SLA Managemen=
t</span></li>
</ul>
<p>Such events would constitute a scope expansion and require architectural=
 review.</p>
<h2 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-RequestSpecifications">Request Spec=
ifications</h2>
<h3 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-Request">Request</h3>
<h4 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-Definition.1">Definition</h4>
<p>A Request represents a consumer-submitted demand for access to a governe=
d resource/feature.</p>
<p>A Request is:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"59c68f59-31fc-41eb-bc51-27f8ca743d2a">Consumer-facing</li=
>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9189f4ad-9fae-4c6a-a3a1-ee61a3b3f7f8">Trackable</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2c76924e-b6c9-4c77-b97a-17401e9c89b3">Auditable</li>
</ul>
<p>A Request is not:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6111caea-7fb4-4054-a97d-5211fa80cb3d">A ticket</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e43f850c-5715-40e2-87e8-22af5761f0bb">A task</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"dde79ca7-7faf-46c1-9fc4-954fbe292162">A case</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1ecd42c4-f985-4510-a063-f7fa168e6c39">An incident</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d54de4a7-ca00-475c-b08c-f05da9382b35">An operational work=
 item</li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-Principles.1">Principles</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Spec. No.</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">RS-001</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Requests represent consumer intent</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>A Request captures the consumer's intent to obtain or modify access=
.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">RS-002</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Requests are consumer-centric</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Requests exist to provide visibility and traceability to consumers.=
</p>
     <p>Requests do not exist to manage internal operational work.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">RS-003</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Requests are independent of processing</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>A Request shall exist independently from any approval, provisioning=
, or operational process.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">RS-004</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Requests are traceable</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Each Request shall be uniquely identifiable and traceable throughou=
t its lifecycle.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">RS-005</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Requests are event-driven</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Request progression shall be represented through lifecycle events.<=
/p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-RequestAttributes">Request Attribut=
es</h4>
<ul>
 <li><span>Request Identifier</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"bdb6b550-64a0-4393-aae6-4a8bdc707972"><span>Request Type<=
/span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"beb21289-d6e6-46de-afa8-2f74a3e823e6"><span>Consumer</spa=
n></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d2aacc06-5d23-4354-adc5-0cfbd113ae6b"><span>Requested Res=
ource</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c86ddf5f-29a4-475e-91db-d43be1bc06bb"><span>Submission Ti=
mestamp</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span>Optional:</span></p>
<ul>
 <li><span>Justification</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7b6c1581-8ff6-4084-b7da-d50698a08f44"><span>Comments</spa=
n></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"ff802c8c-c993-4425-bf49-56ca4b1dc3f4"><span>Additional Me=
tadata</span></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-RequestLifecycle">Request Lifecycle=
</h4>
<p><span>Created <span>=E2=86=92&nbsp;</span></span><span>Progressed Throug=
h Events <span>=E2=86=92&nbsp;</span></span><span>Completed</span></p>
<p>N.B. Request lifecycle progression is defined by lifecycle events rather=
 than workflow actions.</p>
<h3 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-RequestStatus">Request Status</h3>
<h4 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-Princip=
les.2">Principles</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Spec. No.</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">RSS-001</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Consumer-oriented visibility</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Statuses shall communicate meaningful information to consumers.</p>
     <pre><br></pre></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">RSS-002</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Statuses do not represent operational work</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Statuses shall not expose:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f99c6634-7450-42ac-9c4b-982c51540cf6">Assignments</l=
i>
      <li data-uuid=3D"2a8d66b3-b6f6-4771-a0e4-8b864007495e">Queues</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3777a9f9-35f7-4c86-b7cd-b6082418ad0c">Escalations</l=
i>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9290b568-5557-4d89-858f-85966da8b912">Priorities</li=
>
      <li data-uuid=3D"08c23ac0-0333-481a-b750-9247a5ee68a0">Internal workf=
low states</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">RSS-003</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Status is derived</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Status shall be derived from recorded lifecycle events.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">RSS-004</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Status is current state</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>A Request shall have <strong>at most <u>one</u></strong> current st=
atus.</p>
     <p>Historical progression shall be represented through events.</p></td=
>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-SupportedStatuses">Supported Status=
es</h4>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c00abf89-43ee-41e7-8a67-2a7ecf446091"><span>Submitted</sp=
an><br>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"e2d43175-d1af-47ac-b5b0-bcb52ba11108">
    <p>The request has been successfully received.</p></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e5ffa191-a8f1-426b-92ed-7039f77492ba"><span>In Progress</=
span>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"90367e59-39d7-4aab-b702-6469104b83fe">The request is be=
ing processed.</li>
   <li style=3D"color:#172b4d;" data-uuid=3D"e4853529-2392-4a81-bf26-71ad54=
9aaaae"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><strong>N.B.</strong> This status in=
tentionally abstracts internal activities.</span></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8c8d092d-f65c-46ab-ab4a-305007fc01f6"><span>Rejected</spa=
n>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"b7c6e0f1-cf99-4933-95ec-b14a3295586f">
    <p>The request has been denied.</p></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f598bd93-a769-429d-91a9-9ce3c42688b0"><span>Completed</sp=
an><br>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"83e79374-c0c9-4a36-984d-615b2dddb56f">The request has b=
een successfully fulfilled.</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-StatusMapping">Status Mapping</h3>
<h4 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-Princip=
les.3">Principles</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Spec. No.</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">SMS-001</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Events drive status</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Statuses shall be derived from lifecycle events.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">SMS-002</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Multiple events may map to the same status</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Different business events may result in the same consumer-facing st=
atus.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">SMS-003</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Statuses remain stable</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>The introduction of new lifecycle events should not necessarily req=
uire the introduction of new statuses.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-StatusMappingModel">Status Mapping =
Model</h4>
<p><span>Lifecycle Event<span> =E2=86=92&nbsp;</span></span><span>Status Ma=
pping<span> =E2=86=92&nbsp;</span></span><span>Consumer Status</span></p>
<p><span>e.g.</span></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"82758e43-e4c4-459d-b64f-dab0e4adb125"><span>AccessRequest=
Submitted<span> =E2=86=92&nbsp;</span></span><span>Submitted</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"921075c1-78bc-48bb-9854-eed99ae3b8f4"><span>AccessRequest=
Approved<span> =E2=86=92&nbsp;</span></span><span>In Progress</span></li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;"><span>Future evolution:</span></p>
<ul>
