<h2 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-PersistenceSpecifications">Persiste=
nce Specifications</h2>
<h3 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-DataModel">Data Model</h3>
<h4 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-Princip=
les.4">Principles</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Spec. No.</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">DMS-001</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Requests are first-class domain entities</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Requests shall be represented as independent domain entities.</p>
     <p>Requests shall not be inferred from events.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">DMS-002</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Events are the historical record</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Request lifecycle progression shall be represented through recorded=
 events.</p>
     <p>Events provide the historical record of request activity.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">DMS-003</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Status is derived data</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Status shall be derived from lifecycle events.</p>
     <p>Status shall not be treated as the authoritative source of request =
history.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">DMS-004</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Separation of concerns</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Request data, lifecycle history (i.e. events), and derived status s=
hall remain logically distinct concerns.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-CoreEntities">Core Entities</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Entity</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Responsibilities</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Request</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Represents a consumer-submitted access reque=
st.</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"53c79ec8-1aa2-49cf-a958-c7e3403b5322">
       <p>Request identity</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"940e3d87-b1c1-4ed9-bf74-57221655a9b9">
       <p>Request context</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ca7d8e65-4e74-44d7-8967-f3c108ce961f">
       <p>Request ownership</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"0b06cf43-cf69-49be-818a-2ffa75ee58d0">
       <p>Request metadata</p></li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Event</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Represents a lifecycle fact that occurred for a request.</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8baef167-965c-4d3f-816e-6538dd096d93">Auditability</=
li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7937d1b6-b598-4b8e-9f40-18d68cdeb18e">Traceability</=
li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"dc18c48b-887f-4db8-bd5a-b5e237c4ba90">Lifecycle hist=
ory</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7859d9e8-5fd3-4a73-b814-a3a8e4834b05">Status derivat=
ion</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Status</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Represents the current consumer-facing state of a request.</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a856b6a3-dc1f-4d13-948f-eec97c131097">Visibility</li=
>
      <li data-uuid=3D"77ca1b04-16c0-4db3-98a9-66136fa39ea1">User experienc=
e</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a8c6ad74-698a-4c44-af0b-94336e81c8fa">Simplified req=
uest progression</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-Persistence">Persistence</h3>
<h4 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-Princip=
les.5">Principles</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Spec. No.</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">PS-001</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Persistent by default</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Requests and lifecycle events shall be persisted.</p>
     <p>No request lifecycle information shall rely solely on memory or tra=
nsient processing.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">PS-002</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Event retention</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Lifecycle events shall be retained as the historical record of requ=
est progression.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">PS-003</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Traceability</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Requests, events, and statuses shall be traceable to one another.</=
p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">PS-004</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Recoverability</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Current request status shall be recoverable from recorded lifecycle=
 events.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">PS-005</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Auditability</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Persisted data shall support reconstruction of request history.</p>=
</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-ConsistencyRequirements">Consistenc=
y Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Req. No.</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">PCR-001</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Request / Event consistency</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>A request shall not exist without a corresponding submission event.=
</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">PCR-002</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Status consistency</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>The current request status shall be consistent with the recorded li=
fecycle events.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">PCR-003</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Event ordering</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Events associated with a request shall support chronological recons=
truction of request history.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"PlatformAccessManagement(PAM)-RecoveryRequirements">Recovery Requ=
irements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Req. No.</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">PRR-001</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Status reconstruction</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>The platform shall be capable of reconstructing request status from=
 lifecycle events.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">PRR-002</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Timeline reconstruction</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>The platform shall be capable of reconstructing request timelines f=
rom lifecycle events.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">PRR-003</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Notification recovery</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>The persisted event history shall support regeneration of request-r=
elated notifications if required.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
